* NMOS transistor where Drain is Y, Gate is X, Source is 0 (ground)
M1 Y X 0 0 NMOS

* Resistors
R1 2 3 /* Resistance between net 2 and VDD */
RD Y 3 /* Resistance between net Y and VDD */
R2 2 0 /* Resistance between net 2 and ground */

* Capacitor
C1 D 2 /* Capacitance between input D and net 2 */

* Voltage Source
VDD 3 0 DC /* DC Voltage source VDD between net 3 and ground */

* Input
Vin D 0 SIN(0V 1V 1kHz) /* Example input source - Modify as needed */

* .model statement for NMOS
.model NMOS NMOS LEVEL=1